{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hold the Mine, explore a long-forgotten mine, gather precious resources, and build powerful structures that synergize with the heroes you unleash along the way. As night falls, defend your mine against relentless waves of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Hold the line and survive until the sun rises!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/b0310e4ca87d5f69d93a0ce7292340e8.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you\u2019ll guide your dwarf through the mine with a limited number of expeditions, allowing you to mine several blocks in a row. Optimize your route and let them do the rest! But be careful not to venture too far into the unknown \u2014 who knows what dangers lurk in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/387ae39eb51bc335f8a40b98ee4c362a.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/387ae39eb51bc335f8a40b98ee4c362a.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/9db0444a799ddff4aa2ddc69f6a8c556.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to construct powerful buildings with unique effects. Discover blueprints and create smart synergies that boost your progress and defense as the mine grows deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/82245cd9974b91e589133b3a7bf54561.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/82245cd9974b91e589133b3a7bf54561.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/4481924a06c67f5d84b15027d239eb70.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free heroes trapped within the mine and enhance them using mysterious runes and exotic fruits found along the way. Unlock their abilities and upgrade their stats to unleash their full potential and protect the gate each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/f230ed45d6bdb7a1fbe0348f74e02e7a.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/f230ed45d6bdb7a1fbe0348f74e02e7a.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/df0ddf194ba21df634ce305d36ce0b54.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain buildings allow you to use battle-changing powers when the time is right. Use them wisely to help your heroes hold back the army of monsters sent by the cursed tower and prevent the mine's door from being blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/2b7922844fd940ef4a1da1d9441ddbf4.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/2b7922844fd940ef4a1da1d9441ddbf4.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ heroes with over 35 abilities to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ buildings and relics with their own unique effects and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ types of blocks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes, each with distinct twists to choose from for every run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: The perfect mode to discover Hold the Mine. Explore the mine and defend it from relentless hordes of monsters each night!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into Darkness</strong>: Darkness envelops the mine, reducing your visibility to zero. Find the Ancient Lights to guide your path to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice Age</strong>: Deadly frost spreads wherever your dwarf goes. Don\u2019t linger too long on the same level\u2014corruption deepens with each expedition and can bring your journey to a sudden end.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164960?t=1764607333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3164960?t=1764607333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/d759a4f13ce45383d9e02b06e6425d9972af72a2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764607333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/d759a4f13ce45383d9e02b06e6425d9972af72a2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764607333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3939600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hold the Mine, explore a long-forgotten mine, gather precious resources, and build powerful structures that synergize with the heroes you unleash along the way. As night falls, defend your mine against relentless waves of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? Hold the line and survive until the sun rises!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/b0310e4ca87d5f69d93a0ce7292340e8.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day, you\u2019ll guide your dwarf through the mine with a limited number of expeditions, allowing you to mine several blocks in a row. Optimize your route and let them do the rest! But be careful not to venture too far into the unknown \u2014 who knows what dangers lurk in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/387ae39eb51bc335f8a40b98ee4c362a.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/387ae39eb51bc335f8a40b98ee4c362a.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/9db0444a799ddff4aa2ddc69f6a8c556.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your resources to construct powerful buildings with unique effects. Discover blueprints and create smart synergies that boost your progress and defense as the mine grows deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/82245cd9974b91e589133b3a7bf54561.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/82245cd9974b91e589133b3a7bf54561.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/4481924a06c67f5d84b15027d239eb70.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free heroes trapped within the mine and enhance them using mysterious runes and exotic fruits found along the way. Unlock their abilities and upgrade their stats to unleash their full potential and protect the gate each night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/f230ed45d6bdb7a1fbe0348f74e02e7a.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/f230ed45d6bdb7a1fbe0348f74e02e7a.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/df0ddf194ba21df634ce305d36ce0b54.avif?t=1764607333\" width=652 height=126 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain buildings allow you to use battle-changing powers when the time is right. Use them wisely to help your heroes hold back the army of monsters sent by the cursed tower and prevent the mine's door from being blown up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/2b7922844fd940ef4a1da1d9441ddbf4.poster.avif?t=1764607333\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164960/extras/2b7922844fd940ef4a1da1d9441ddbf4.webm?t=1764607333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ heroes with over 35 abilities to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ buildings and relics with their own unique effects and powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ types of blocks to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 game modes, each with distinct twists to choose from for every run:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: The perfect mode to discover Hold the Mine. Explore the mine and defend it from relentless hordes of monsters each night!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Into Darkness</strong>: Darkness envelops the mine, reducing your visibility to zero. Find the Ancient Lights to guide your path to success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ice Age</strong>: Deadly frost spreads wherever your dwarf goes. Don\u2019t linger too long on the same level\u2014corruption deepens with each expedition and can bring your journey to a sudden end.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Hookar